### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/

### Contacts API
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts

### (getContactById)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6ac8ae5a7cf30af08dd0a170

### (addContact)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alice Dupont",
    "age": 31
}

### (updateContact)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6af1fb9e891a5a4a73f33fbd
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Bob Martin",
    "age": 56
}


### (removeContact)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6af1f8e6f8b6f5f840eb74c3